      "writtenOn": "2022-12-05T11:24:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure if it\u0027s so untypical to gather all the errors in a separate module. Others do this too like in CPython.\n\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/blob/c8c6113398ee9a7867fe9b08bc539cceb61e2aaa/Objects/exceptions.c",
      "parentUuid": "390d9dc4_f3faa640",
